{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "21171f11e471168a9606a08fac93335459798bd052a3d0f49e0668d85b14996c", "ja": "もう一つの太陽", "zh": "另一个太阳", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "35f10b6f54664fc683aa83b12030128dc89371394caa1486a8dcae1109089f83", "ja": "『765PRO ALLSTARS』による、新たな\n天体公演企画が始動！　その第一弾『ソル』\nのメンバーに選ばれた律子、亜美、真美、\nやよい、美希の5人は、マイペースながらも\nやる気を見せる。", "zh": "由“765PRO ALLSTARS”带来的崭新\n天体公演企划正式启动！入选其第一弹“索尔”\n成员的律子、亚美、真美、\n弥生、美希5人，虽说各自随性，\n但也展现出了满满的干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1000_null", "source_sha256": "668a9b0c279f88898c194201e7bc7223af5f1e9ce2c8e7bcc8407a9b0c427a10", "ja": "天体公演『ソル』、キックオフミーティング……", "zh": "天体公演“Sol”启动会议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "4810f8995f3ce1f174840ebc27d026283a73b6c4fffbab202b4ab9073b5ef691", "ja": "あふぅ。ミキ、始まるまで寝てるから、\n{$P$}に「起こして」って言ってね。", "zh": "啊呼。美希在开始之前先睡会儿，\n记得跟{$P$}说一声“叫她起床”哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "053c75043c70b24bb297d0b8daa05ca752e734eadfc217c9f61af4d4433a0ace", "ja": "ええっ？　それって、\n私が直接起こしちゃダメなのかな……？", "zh": "诶？也就是说，不能由我直接叫醒她吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "bcfa8c549798f35c750989afe0581b363e99fef72645f7842f00dc987f559713", "ja": "こらっ、美希！　もうすぐなんだから、\nちゃんと起きてなさい。", "zh": "喂，美希！马上就要到了，给我好好醒着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "d943760ab720b067d6995c5bcae280b6c34fa6a8795285e5604629678a11a609", "ja": "あれ？　律っちゃんにやよいっち……ミキミキも。\nみんな兄ちゃんに呼ばれてんの？", "zh": "咦？律子姐、小弥生……还有美希美希。大家都是被哥哥叫来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "d6142f9f8d0d6e822b880d19f799cd3e07279b3efe5fbf56ac8cbc792da44d6f", "ja": "あら、亜美と真美も？\nふーん、このメンバーってことは……。", "zh": "咦，亚美和真美也在？\n嗯——既然是这些成员，那就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "a2e6716d59204c44671aed1628565e914ce98c176745b0e099612d36de6f08bb", "ja": "真美達だけじゃなくて、こんなに声を掛けてたなんて。\nいやぁ、兄ちゃんもスミに置けませんなぁ。", "zh": "不只是我们真美她们，居然还邀请了这么多人啊。\n哎呀，哥哥真是深藏不露呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4d159f76385a73aa8ddcfd56574e2682bd1e98ddcc5824cfba20d13621980bd1", "ja": "スミに置いといてくれていいぞ。\nちゃんとした、仕事の話だからな。", "zh": "把我放在角落里也没关系。是正经的工作上的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "9f4b3cf35585a74ef56f867f2fa5e96f96b1f0ff5b145a99fa16d7deefca9a6a", "ja": "あっ、兄ちゃん！　オツカレー、カツカレー。\nなになに、面白い話？", "zh": "啊，哥！辛苦啦，猪排咖喱！\n什么什么，是有趣的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "dda2b8c50ff3a94b79186c6c8de06a17078e7772c2c0c872095a23d5f386678d", "ja": "{$P$}、もう来ちゃったの？\nじゃあミキ、急いで寝るから、優しく起こしてね☆", "zh": "{$P$}，你已经来啦？\n那美希这就赶紧睡觉，要温柔地叫醒我哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "f0f02433099573c0c943da1f97d97ce1d63af33857ae67f790b2e94f25635e8d", "ja": "あ、あのっ、{$P$}！\n美希さんが起きてるうちに、始めちゃいましょー！", "zh": "啊、那个，{$P$}！\n趁美希还醒着，我们开始吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9dc6206d1e4b05f5433082cbeeb59b0a9984aa6c5ea88f5dd0e21f9161e75cf5", "ja": "あ、ああ、そうだな！　ええと。\n今回みんなにお願いしたいのは……。", "zh": "啊、啊啊，对啊！呃，这次想拜托大家的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "c7800ced0eb79782d328aaeca226c2a32baa1042f7dfcbd855426b015eb7fa4c", "ja": "おおっ、天体公演ツアー！？\nんじゃ、いよいよ亜美たちの出番ってことだね！", "zh": "哦哦，天体公演巡演！？  \n那就是说，终于轮到亚美她们出场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "831b7972caaaa899b181b3cdd642c66796c9a90389e8034715e4533ca44b4707", "ja": "ああ！　みんな、最近は忙しくなってきてるから、\nツアーは大変だと思うけど、頑張ってもらいたいんだ。", "zh": "啊！大家最近都越来越忙了，\n我知道巡演会很辛苦，但还是希望你们能加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b8f650493ec7453be1b64f1f5df2498eabd2d85da5f722398d66e34c7adb9e85", "ja": "同時に劇場では別の企画を展開する予定なんだ。\nまだ企画段階だから、ツアーが先行する形になる。", "zh": "同时剧场这边也打算展开另外的企划。\n不过目前还处于企划阶段，所以会是由巡演先行展开的形式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "cccb802341c6b38017e7afb9e94ba30b1749a0266e621d852b02113d0f48a6ae", "ja": "なるほど。つまり劇場の外と中、\n両方で盛り上げていこうってことですね？", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，要在剧场内外两边一起炒热气氛，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "3c7cf7761ed22a53abb355c4a432b80e90d0354071cdc7889a0ff62fc6cbeadc", "ja": "これは責任ジューダイ、ニジューダイですな～。", "zh": "这可是责任重大、双重重大啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "45751a7ae0636d4caf063dd4414302f2524303828251e26c604c45cad066e608", "ja": "あはっ、面白そうなの！　ミキ、大変なのはヤだけど、\n面白いことは、けっこー頑張れるって思うな♪", "zh": "啊哈，好像很有意思呢！美希虽然讨厌麻烦的事，\n不过要是好玩的事情，就觉得能挺努力的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "7408d87d73c5537b04cf5a099adb1953a1cb7509faea73e129338a4545db868b", "ja": "あ、私達は『ソル』っていう名前なんですね！\nソル……ソル……。えっと、どういう意味ですかー？", "zh": "啊，我们的名字叫“Sol”呀！\nSol……Sol……那个，这是什么意思呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1020_011ami", "source_sha256": "2162d82ec068acd2797318688a773bd55be2f7b655c2ee6e97ad1bb199bc734c", "ja": "身体をソル！", "zh": "把身体剃掉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "0fafb7ade5759cb988ddbfbb2b15ff61a5547dc0cf3aae5b7c9c891e1c6acf2c", "ja": "ヒゲをソル！", "zh": "把胡子“索尔”掉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f30a15573be451eee5fbb257cee8867085c80f1919c96aa1964966fcbabb44d7", "ja": "違うぞ？　ラテン語で『太陽』のこと。天体公演では\n『Sunshine Rhythm!』公演をしているけど……", "zh": "不是那个意思哦？在拉丁语里是‘太阳’的意思。虽然天体公演举办的是‘Sunshine Rhythm!’公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "cb5ab89e6d6982a5d74f2ab4ab343ce9df14b68ec34d845bf8b6d8b8c4ec9826", "ja": "みんなには、みんなならではの太陽として、\n最高にカッコいい姿を見せて欲しいんだ。", "zh": "我希望你们能作为独具你们特色的太阳，\n展现出最帅气的身姿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1024_011ami", "source_sha256": "b5e5411ce89e9fe405aee08d4c887ca8c22f21bda81c81b4036b8e67f33d507c", "ja": "オッケーだよー！　今こそ時は満ちた……。\n亜美たちの真の輝きを見せてくれよう！　ピカーッ！！", "zh": "没问题！现在时机已经成熟……  \n就让你们见识一下亚美等人的真正光辉吧！闪亮——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "276c06fe9eb6c69e437ebbadee5840bfbffb881e64ac529896411411179c3df1", "ja": "わかりました。ツアーでこのメンバー、ということは…\nさしずめ私は、お目付け役ってとこですかね？", "zh": "明白了。巡演配上这样的阵容，也就是说……\n我多半得充当监护人的角色了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "2e3f0266a3fd6b3e374675a632e671a295614fb9461c7ccf3e7683f9fdc29dd9", "ja": "いや、律子の役割は、ステージで輝くことだよ。\nお目付け役とかは、こっちに任せてくれ。", "zh": "不，律子的职责，是在舞台上闪耀。\n监督大家这种事，交给我就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "17413c3d5f6ddc52bb18fb0e9e64c1e953e372deeeea833d5a4172106ccbb430", "ja": "あら、そう来ましたか。\nふふっ、了解です。頼みましたよ！", "zh": "哎呀，居然这么说啊。\n呵呵，了解。那就拜托你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1028_011ami", "source_sha256": "468609ad0646a96eab2748403841bec460c7f06ed452bf3113af4030b64de8f7", "ja": "よく言ったね、兄ちゃん！　その期待に応えて、\n全力の亜美をお見舞いしてあげるよ！", "zh": "说得好，哥哥！为了回应你的期待，就让你见识一下全力以赴的亚美吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1029_012mam", "source_sha256": "3f4aa7516bda4fca4f8748615fa54740bc30662ccb4b7d85cfbd65ef774d1150", "ja": "律っちゃんズ・アイから解き放たれた、真美のセクシー\nビームをくらうがいい！　あっはんは～ん☆", "zh": "尝尝摆脱了律子法眼的真美、性感\n光线的厉害吧！啊哈哈～嗯☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1030_009rit", "source_sha256": "9a970a02157555dd12a3304103dbf7889fc3750d8ceeeef25f9ba5e3f4f16865", "ja": "……。本当に大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "……真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "d212c32b401f4af5f0bd9e86a9dbf1f4aa190b769b2f83a043faa484178a8dc2", "ja": "あ、ああ。後で相談させてもらうかも……。", "zh": "啊，啊啊。之后可能还要请你帮忙商量一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "ebc500027ef3e69c1533fce21c5e8874a28b7c6cff6823d0a94b007c8ce366e9", "ja": "あ、そうだ！　みんなに歌ってもらう曲も、\nもうできてるから。聞いてみてくれ……これだ。", "zh": "啊，对了！让大家唱的歌也已经做好了。你听听看……就是这首。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_1033", "source_sha256": "8f53c732739f30ac3760e773e42cc8ba8408401dc7bb6192fb61c6c447ee51cb", "ja": "［再生］", "zh": "［播放］", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_2001_003mik", "source_sha256": "95e21d9568fe0555ad9790edaf4bf8114cc581dfec6f9398eb77658558fa991a", "ja": "……ん、いい曲だね。\nミキ、これならやる気出てきたかも？　あはっ☆", "zh": "……嗯，挺不错的歌呢。\n美希觉得要是这首的话，搞不好就有干劲了？啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_2002_009rit", "source_sha256": "1f85dac069b543c2552179d29271175f4c2bd809833cc1daf5999920aec50afb", "ja": "現金なんだから……ふふっ。でも、私も美希のこと\n言えないか。やっぱり曲を聴くと燃えてきますね！", "zh": "真是现实啊……呵呵。不过，我也没资格说美希吧。果然一听到歌曲就燃起来了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_2003_011ami", "source_sha256": "edc1f622ddaa1de6d617dfc6c4dd4419a0f78438fe57d0ab491d138f083efc7e", "ja": "うんうん、なんかめっちゃカッコいいよね！\n燃えてきた！　たぎってきた！　フオオオオ！", "zh": "嗯嗯，感觉超帅气的呢！\n燃起来了！热血沸腾了！呼喔喔喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_2004_012mam", "source_sha256": "00d73dfa9e825d5e2e093baf74816b1cad11b25cb40a72e91bcbe6960fdb00fa", "ja": "熱くてクールな感じってことだね！\nオッケーだぜ！　クールに決めるぜ！　だぜ！", "zh": "就是说要营造出热情又酷炫的感觉吧！\nOK！就要帅气地登场！帅吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_2005_005yay", "source_sha256": "5f418780ca79ad28298a28c6d852438582a52a2820c2291f13360e2a0720a625", "ja": "えへへっ、私もメラメラーってしてきました！\nみんなでカッコよく、頑張りましょー！", "zh": "嘿嘿，我也变得燃烧起来了！\n大家一起帅气地加油吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_2006_p", "source_sha256": "f6659b166a91a5810d96c1627b920dd663e7aad69a6be80233966921f11ab6be", "ja": "新しい天体公演と、新しい劇場公演企画……。\n『ソル』はその第一弾として、開幕を飾る公演になる。", "zh": "全新的天体公演，以及全新的剧场公演企划……\n“太阳”将作为其中的第一弹，成为拉开帷幕的公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_01_2007_p", "source_sha256": "c8431c988ead2ac4e5d10dfc6f6bfba71ad217b4332b8b676801df08bcf493d1", "ja": "ファンの期待に応えて、\n最高の輝きを見せてくれ！　よろしくな！", "zh": "回应粉丝的期待，展现最耀眼的光芒！就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
